# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Casio proprietary firmware — NEVER commit.
# The fx-CG50 OS images / flash dumps are Casio's copyrighted property. You must
# supply your own dump of your own calculator (see README and tools/flash_dump/).
# The whole os/ tree (physical flash dump, the 3.80 updater, and everything
# extracted/decoded from them) is excluded — EXCEPT our own on-device probe
# captures (os/devic_probes/): tiny register/CPU measurement dumps + the add-in
# source that produced them. Those contain no Casio firmware and may help others.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/os/*
!/os/devic_probes/

# State/memory snapshots and boot goldens that are *derived from executing* the
# Casio OS (they contain OS bytes / OS-execution results).
emu/*.pkl
emu/golden_boot.bin
emu_go/fb_raw.bin
re/_phone_state.bin
emu_go/fmt_snapshot.bin
emu_go/fmt_trace_go.txt
emu_go/eval_calls.txt

# Screenshots / framebuffer renders of the copyrighted on-screen UI.
*.png
*.bmp
# ...except our own add-in icons (fxSDK needs them to build the probes).
!tools/*/assets-cg/*.png
!docs/images/*.png

# Personal tooling tied to a private endpoint — not part of the emulator.
tools/push_note.py

# Build artifacts
*.exe

# Python / editor cruft
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local Claude Code harness config (machine-specific permissions/paths)
.claude/

# add-in build outputs / toolchain build logs
tools/*/build-cg/
tools/*/*.g3a
tools/fxsdk-docker/build.err
tools/fxsdk-docker/build.log

# fetched on demand by re/audit_keymap.py (third-party libfxcg header)
re/libfxcg_keyboard.h
# downloads cached by re/syscall_names.py (third-party sources; only the derived names are kept)
re/_cache/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# MkDocs build output (the wiki site)
wiki/site/

# Android release signing: the properties file holds the keystore password; keystores never
# belong in the repo (the release keystore lives outside it).
android/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# local probe for an OS 3.80.1 stand-in flash (kept for later checks, not published)
emu_go/khicas380_probe_test.go
